   "k": "h7aeak",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ or just ⟦1⟧ is a releasable state of ⟦2⟧ and ⟦3⟧. When used with the Yugoslavia Fragmentation Status rule(which can be found in the custom game rules), it borders Slovenia to the northwest, Hungary to the northeast, Serbia to the east, Bosnia and Herzegovina and Montenegro to the southeast, and shares a maritime border with Italy to the west.",
